{
  "slug": "timeout",
  "name": "Timeout",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A lightweight plugin that estimates task duration, automatically opens a timer, and reminds you to step away while Claude works. Reduce passive screen time during AI-assisted coding.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `break` (Start a break timer and step away from the screen), `timeout-settings` (View or configure timeout plugin settings (thresholds, timer behavior, break duration)), `timeout-status` (Show current session duration, prompt count, and break history)\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`, `TaskCreated`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install timeout@claude-community` from `almandsky/timeout`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
